WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:01.772
SPEAKER: The Cloud
Architecture Quest

00:00:01.772 --> 00:00:03.840
provides hands-on lab
practice on topics

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.980
related to the Associate Cloud
Engineer Certification exam.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.620
Click Enroll in this
quest to get started.

00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.990
Beginning with the Cloud
IAM Qwik Start Lab,

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:15.120
complete all labs in this Quest.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:17.760
Make sure to review related
product documentation that

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:20.010
is linked from the
lab instructions.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:22.590
The Qwiklabs catalog has
hundreds of self-paced labs

00:00:22.590 --> 00:00:24.130
on various topics.

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:26.430
It is highly recommended
that you complete the labs

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:29.100
in the GCP Essentials
Quest and more

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:31.943
to get additional
hands-on practice.

00:00:31.943 --> 00:00:34.110
Remember, the more you
practice, the more proficient

00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.570
you will be in the topics
related to the Associate Cloud

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.670
Engineer Certification exam.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:40.350
When you complete
Qwiklabs quests,

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:42.900
you will receive Qwiklabs
badges that you can showcase on

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:44.705
your LinkedIn or
social media profile

00:00:44.705 --> 00:00:46.080
to highlight your
accomplishments

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.470
to potential employers.

